atom	man_general	man has general ideas
atom	distinction	the having of general ideas puts a perfect distinction betwixt man and brutes
atom	brutes_particular	brutes reason only in particular ideas, just as they receive them from their senses
atom	distinguishing	abstraction is made the distinguishing property of brutes as against men
atom	many_men_brutes	a great many of those that pass for men must be reckoned into the number of brutes
